  "problem": "Find $x$, if $3a+2x=b$ and\n\n$$\na=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}9 \\\\ -4 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}].\n$$",
